   [DecidablePred (·∈C₁)] (hf:∀ x (hx:x∈C₁ ∩ C₂),f₁ ⟨x,hx.1⟩=f₂ ⟨x,hx.2⟩)
   (x:C₀) (hx:x.val∈C₁):
